WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Good morning. We're here at the farm,

00:03.000 --> 00:05.900
and we're going to look at
the results of the product,

00:05.900 --> 00:09.500
used at 200 ml per 100 liters
every 4 days.

00:09.500 --> 00:12.900
Here we see zucchini plants
treated with the biological fertilizer,

00:12.900 --> 00:17.500
with smooth, marketable fruit:

00:17.500 --> 00:23.300
healthy plants,
with well-developed fruit.

00:23.300 --> 00:27.000
Treated plants,

00:27.000 --> 00:31.200
with zucchini and balanced growth.
